msgid ""
"Choose what happens when clicking a running app with the left mouse button."
msgstr ""
"Kies wat gebeur wanneer 'n lopende toepassing met die linkermuisknoppie "
"geklik word."

#: docking/ui/settings.py:791
msgid "Middle Click"
msgstr "Middle Click"

